{
  "Name": "Gambio Online Webshop unauthenticated PHP Deserialization Vulnerability",
  "Description": "A Remote Code Execution vulnerability in Gambio online webshop version 4.9.2.0 and lower allows remote attackers to run arbitrary commands via unauthenticated HTTP POST request. The identified vulnerability within Gambio pertains to an insecure deserialization flaw, which ultimately allows an attacker to execute remote code on affected systems. The insecure deserialization vulnerability in Gambio poses a significant risk to affected systems. As it allows remote code execution, adversaries could exploit this flaw to execute arbitrary commands, potentially resulting in complete system compromise, data exfiltration, or unauthorized access to sensitive information.",
